From 31b8e2d24dd1ec7953afbb310a66df04ef2ce806 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:23:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(process): refresh a conflicting PR only at merge
 time; merge-plan planner

A conflicting PR is refreshed only when a merge batch is about to merge
it, never at session start. `cargo xtask merge-plan` orders a set of PRs
in waves (wave 1 merges with no refresh, wave 2 one refresh at a time),
and `--delta` classifies what changed since a reviewed head: a clean
merge of main keeps its review. Review markers and merge-ready count only
from the owner's account. One batch gate per merge batch.

PROCESS_VERSION 31.

Fixes #1221

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
