From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:46:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] build(process): fix round - octopus merges, GitHub
 mergeable, ready flag, owner repo

Octopus merges of main are NEW CODE. GitHub's mergeable decides a
git-clean PR too (plain refresh in wave 2). The ready flag after a
merge-time refresh is set by the merging session right before the merge.
The owner lookup names the base repository. Scratch refs are deleted.

Fixes #1221

